  "details": "Currently, there is no way to read out the analog value for Index controllers on their grip button, it's just 0 or 1. VRChat uses a value in between those when you grip a pickup, in Udon however it's unusable since a slight amount of grip is already '1' and thus triggered by accident all the time. Please give us the analog value or at least a better '0' and '1' that is also used for pickups.",
